      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid quenching after aging will preserve the desired precipitate size and distribution.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The desired property combination is available only within a narrow aging-time and aging-temperature window.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6170471::web::023::estimation_of_strengthening_by_various_m"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ordered coherent nanoprecipitates impede dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6170471::web::011::discussion",
        "PMC6170471::web::023::estimation_of_strengthening_by_various_m"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed B2 precipitates will strengthen the alloy through Orowan bypass.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent-interface effects will create a load-bearing framework in the FCC matrix.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanoprecipitates will increase yield strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6170471::web::011::discussion",
        "PMC6170471::web::023::estimation_of_strengthening_by_various_m"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanoprecipitates will increase the apparent Young's modulus.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanoprecipitates will redistribute local stresses and delay crack initiation and propagation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
